bbfb0">斜体</span></em><span data-lake-id="u618d0f05" id="u618d0f05">、</span><code data-lake-id="u6d261d70" id="u6d261d70"><span data-lake-id="u1f21d21f" id="u1f21d21f">代码</span></code><span data-lake-id="uf3325247" id="uf3325247">、</span><del><span data-lake-id="u0d7ebdf9" id="u0d7ebdf9">删除线</span></del><span data-lake-id="u80966256" id="u80966256">等，确保它们在长文本中也能正确渲染。最后，段落以句号结束。</span></p>